                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-03-11"><hi rendition="#italic">March 11,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The minister again asks what is to be done about sugar, and calls attention to
                    his telegram of March 5.</p>
